				<PLAIN-TEXT>&quot;Implementation of SAF Concept Physical External SystemPhysical External System: The Physical External System in the Physical Domain, outside the SOI scope, interacting with the SOI. E.g. power grid, mobile network, fresh water system (in a house).&quot;</PLAIN-TEXT>
			</DESCRIPTION>
		</ELEMENT>
