			<DESCRIPTION>
				<PLAIN-TEXT>&quot;Implementation of SAF Concept System Partial FunctionSystem Partial Function: Specifies the fact that a System Partial Function is a decomposed part of a System Function and defines details of the System Function it belongs to.&quot;</PLAIN-TEXT>
			</DESCRIPTION>
